  AID2E Engineering Assistant — vLLM chat template for Qwen/Qwen3.5-122B-A10B-FP8
  ================================================================================
  Based on the official chat_template.jinja shipped in the model repo
  (https://huggingface.co/Qwen/Qwen3.5-122B-A10B-FP8/blob/main/chat_template.jinja).
  All original logic — multimodal content rendering, tool-call XML format,
